#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/explanation/motor-control.md:0
msgid "完整 callback context、校准桥和有限操作预算"
msgstr ""
"Complete callback context, calibration bridge and bounded operation budgets"

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/explanation/motor-control.md:0
msgid "F4 provider"
msgstr "F4 provider"

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/explanation/motor-control.md:0
msgid "TIM8、ADC1、TIM4、所选 IRQ、门钟与引脚的生命周期"
msgstr "Lifecycle of TIM8, ADC1, TIM4, selected IRQs, clock gates and pins"

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/explanation/motor-control.md:0
msgid "经审核的板级授权、供电、模拟前端和功率能力"
msgstr ""
"Reviewed board authorization, supply, analog front end and power capability"

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/explanation/motor-control.md:30
msgid ""
"组件不创建堆、任务、全局时钟或电机注册表。控制数学不包含 HAL；provider 使用私有 厂商类型和经审核的硬件操作。组件 target "
"仅在被明确链接时进入镜像，实例状态由 调用者提供，未选模式不承担其最大缓冲与运行状态。"
msgstr ""
"Components create no heap, tasks, global clock or motor registry. Control "
"mathematics contains no HAL; the provider uses private vendor types and "
"reviewed hardware operations. Component targets enter the image only when "
"explicitly linked. Callers supply instance state; unselected modes pay no "
"maximum-buffer or runtime-state cost."

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/explanation/motor-control.md:0
msgid "执行入口"
msgstr "Entry point"

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/explanation/motor-control.md:0
msgid "合法上下文与推进"
msgstr "Allowed context and progress"

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/explanation/motor-control.md:0
msgid "Axis 命令、参数、step 与停止"
msgstr "Axis commands, parameters, step and stopping"

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/explanation/motor-control.md:0
msgid "同一个 Task 执行者；位置规划不进入 ADC IRQ"
msgstr "One Task executor; position planning does not enter the ADC IRQ"

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/explanation/motor-control.md:0
msgid "Motor step 与数学函数"
msgstr "Motor step and mathematics"

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/explanation/motor-control.md:0
msgid "单一执行者的 Task 或选定 IRQ，满足自身计算预算"
msgstr ""
"A single executor in Task or a selected IRQ, within its computation budget"

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/explanation/motor-control.md:0
msgid "PowerStage prepare／start／service／stop"
msgstr "PowerStage prepare/start/service/stop"

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/explanation/motor-control.md:0
msgid "同一个 privileged、未屏蔽的 Task；显式推进"
msgstr "One privileged, unmasked Task; progress is explicit"

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/explanation/motor-control.md:0
msgid "PowerStage compute"
msgstr "PowerStage compute"

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/explanation/motor-control.md:0
msgid "仅选定 ADC IRQ；不等待 Task、不保存临时指针"
msgstr ""
"Only the selected ADC IRQ; no waiting for Tasks or retaining temporary "
