#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/explanation/motor-control.md:0
msgid "CANopen／CiA402"
msgstr "CANopen/CiA402"

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/explanation/motor-control.md:0
msgid "单个 Thread 执行者，先完成协议 step，再提供有效轴事实"
msgstr ""
"One Thread executor; complete the protocol step before supplying valid axis "
"facts"

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/explanation/motor-control.md:42
msgid "一份决定不等于一个物理结果"
msgstr "A decision is not a physical result"

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/explanation/motor-control.md:44
msgid ""
"应用分别保留原始请求、受约束参考、软件采用、输出计划和测量。Axis 的 `adopted_at` 描述其执行者采用目标的时刻；Motor "
"的输出是归一化 duty 和计划电压。 provider 接受完整 shadow 组，也不证明对应物理边沿已经发生。"
msgstr ""
"Applications retain the original request, constrained reference, software "
"adoption, output plan and measurement separately. Axis `adopted_at` "
"describes when its executor adopts a target; Motor produces normalized duty "
"and planned voltage. Even acceptance of a complete shadow group by the "
"provider does not prove that the physical edge occurred."

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/explanation/motor-control.md:48
msgid ""
"位置、速度、电流、机械角、电角和转矩不能混用。齿比、编码器计数倍率、方向和极对数 分别有明确来源。应用桥将 Axis 选定机械侧的角度和速度换算为 "
"Motor 要求的转子 机械侧，再由电机计算应用极对数；电流参考的单位是 A，不按齿比折算。没有核验转矩 常数与电流约定时，安培目标不能改名为转矩反馈。"
msgstr ""
"Position, velocity, current, mechanical angle, electrical angle and torque "
"are distinct. Gear ratio, encoder count multiplier, direction and pole pairs"
" each need an explicit source. The application bridge converts the angle and"
" velocity from the mechanical side selected for Axis to the rotor mechanical"
" side required by Motor; motor computation then applies the pole pairs. The "
"current reference is in A and is never scaled by the gear ratio. Without "
"verified torque constants and current conventions, an ampere target cannot "
"be renamed torque feedback."

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/explanation/motor-control.md:53
msgid "采样、观察与计划输出分别计时"
msgstr "Time sampling, observation and planned output separately"

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/explanation/motor-control.md:55
msgid ""
"Motor 输入区分 `sample_time_us`、`angle_time_us`、`observed_at_us` 和 "
"`apply_time_us`。角度可以在采样之后、观察之前取得，随后在明确误差预算内向采样 "
"时刻回投影或向输出时刻预测。预测使用调用者提供的有效机械速度；软件读取时刻 不自动成为采样孔径。"
msgstr ""
"Motor input distinguishes `sample_time_us`, `angle_time_us`, "
"`observed_at_us` and `apply_time_us`. The angle may be obtained after "
"sampling and before observation, then projected back to sampling or forward "
"to output within an explicit error budget. Prediction uses caller-supplied "
"valid mechanical velocity; a software-read time does not automatically "
"become a sampling aperture."

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/explanation/motor-control.md:60
msgid ""
"F407ZG `injected-power-stage` 参考使用边沿对齐 TIM8、ADC1 四个顺序 injected rank，以及 TIM4 "
"编码器观察。前三 rank 是 raw 相电流，第四个是 raw 母线电压。 `sample_at` 是计划触发参考，`scan_span_us` "
"是声明的转换跨度；三相不是同时采样。 应用桥必须说明顺序采样近似和角度估计的适用范围，不能靠重写时间戳伪造同步。"
msgstr ""
"The F407ZG `injected-power-stage` reference uses edge-aligned TIM8, four "
"sequential ADC1 injected ranks and TIM4 encoder observation. The first three"
" ranks contain raw phase currents; the fourth contains raw bus voltage. "
"`sample_at` is the scheduled trigger reference and `scan_span_us` the "
"declared conversion span; the phases are not sampled simultaneously. The "
"application bridge must state where its sequential-sampling approximation "
"and angle estimate apply. Rewriting timestamps cannot fabricate "
"synchronization."

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/explanation/motor-control.md:65
msgid ""
"有效窗口同时受 duty、deadtime、模拟稳定时间、转换、IRQ 延迟、compute 和提交 预算约束。调制器的数学余量不能代替 "
"provider 的窗口检查，更不能证明真实模拟 稳定时间。当前参考不声明中心对齐、多 ADC 同时采样、单分流或无感换相。"
msgstr ""
"The valid window is jointly constrained by duty, deadtime, analog settling, "
"conversion, IRQ latency, compute and commit budgets. Mathematical modulator "
"headroom does not replace provider window checks or prove physical analog "
"settling. This reference does not claim center alignment, simultaneous "
"multi-ADC sampling, single-shunt operation or sensorless commutation."

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/explanation/motor-control.md:69
msgid "三种期限保持独立"
msgstr "Keep three kinds of deadline independent"

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/explanation/motor-control.md:71
msgid "外部命令有效期决定旧运动参考还能否使用，重复帧和心跳不自动续期。"
msgstr ""
"External command validity determines whether an old motion reference remains"
" usable. Repeated frames and heartbeats do not automatically renew it."

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/explanation/motor-control.md:72
msgid ""
"PowerStage 用单独的 `startup_deadline` 约束启动；非阻塞长期 session 的 `base.deadline` 为 "
"`NX_DEADLINE_NEVER`，运行直到显式停止或故障。"
msgstr ""
"PowerStage bounds startup with a separate `startup_deadline`. The "
"nonblocking long-lived session uses `NX_DEADLINE_NEVER` for `base.deadline` "
"and runs until explicit stop or fault."

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/explanation/motor-control.md:74
msgid "service、清理尝试和维护使用各自有界执行；超时不能撤销借用或证明已经断能。"
msgstr ""
"Service, cleanup attempts and maintenance each have bounded execution. "
"Timeout cannot revoke a borrow or prove deenergization."

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/explanation/motor-control.md:76
msgid ""
"Task 通过显式 service 推进启动及最终排空；选定 ADC IRQ 只执行有界 callback。 任务不得逐字段改动被 IRQ "
"借用的算法状态。跨上下文目标与参数通过已有有界对象 交接，普通结构体复制不构成同步协议。软件只能在 callback 返回后检测其超预算， 不能用 "
"deadline 抢占一个不返回的计算。"
msgstr ""
"The Task explicitly services startup and final drainage; the selected ADC "
"IRQ executes only a bounded callback. Tasks must not change algorithm state "
"borrowed by the IRQ field by field. Cross-context targets and parameters "
"pass through an existing bounded object handoff; an ordinary structure copy "
"is not a synchronization protocol. Software can detect a callback budget "
"overrun only after it returns. A deadline cannot preempt computation that "
"never returns."

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/explanation/motor-control.md:81
msgid "故障与退出沿着原 owner 完成"
msgstr "Faults and withdrawal follow the original owner"

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/explanation/motor-control.md:83
msgid ""
"计算错误、角度过期、非法采样或完整输出失败关闭相应准入。Motor 算法故障不能 替代硬件抑制；应用仍按 PowerStage 合同 "
"stop／service。输出关闭后，session 和 全部 context 仍保留到 acquire 观察 `SETTLED`。退出失败保持 "
"`QUARANTINED`， 不能清零状态后复用，也不能用恢复同一个 epoch 数值伪装新会话。"
msgstr ""
"Computation errors, stale angles, invalid samples or failed complete outputs"
" close the corresponding admission. A Motor algorithm fault cannot replace "
"hardware inhibition; the application must still stop/service under the "
"PowerStage contract. After output inhibition, the session and all context "
"remain borrowed until an acquire observation of `SETTLED`. Failed withdrawal"
" retains `QUARANTINED`: storage cannot be zeroed and reused, and restoring "
"the same epoch value cannot masquerade as a new session."

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/explanation/motor-control.md:88
msgid ""
"受控减速依赖仍有效的反馈、供电和能量处理。硬件 stop 是输出与源撤回，不是机械 "
"减速或功率隔离。升降承重、抱闸、机械回零和整机重新启动条件属于外部应用；电角 偏置、编码器参考和机械零位分别建立有效性。"
msgstr ""
"Controlled deceleration requires feedback, supply and energy handling that "
"remain valid. Hardware stop withdraws outputs and sources; it does not "
"promise mechanical deceleration or power isolation. Load support, brakes, "
"mechanical homing and whole-machine restart conditions belong to the "
"external application. Electrical offset, encoder reference and mechanical "
"zero establish their validity separately."

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/explanation/motor-control.md:92
msgid "软件项目提供各自范围的证据"
msgstr "Software projects provide evidence within their own scope"

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/explanation/motor-control.md:94
msgid ""
"独立示例仓库的双轮 SIL 运行实际 C 控制和独立 DC／机械模型；控制器只看模拟 "
"传感器，验收器可以读取模型真值。轮速、里程计和地面真值分别报告。固定窗口缺样 不能填成零误差；课程参数只属于明确的教学 profile。"
msgstr ""
"The external differential-drive SIL executes actual C control with an "
"independent DC/mechanical model. The controller sees simulated sensors; the "
"evaluator may read model truth. Wheel velocity, odometry and ground truth "
"are reported separately. Missing samples in a fixed window cannot become "
"zero error. Course parameters belong only to an explicit teaching profile."

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/explanation/motor-control.md:98
msgid ""
"PMSM 数学模型、生产 C 寄存器模型、ARM 链接、安装 SDK 消费和物理测量是不同 证据。DC 模型通过不授予 PMSM 或实板能力；当前物理 "
"HIL 保持 `not_executed`。 MCSDK 不是自有控制核的依赖，尚未接入的后端也不占位声明为已支持。"
msgstr ""
"PMSM mathematical models, production-C register models, ARM linking, "
"installed-SDK consumption and physical measurements provide different "
"evidence. Passing a DC model does not qualify PMSM operation or a board; "
"physical HIL remains `not_executed`. MCSDK is not a dependency of the self-"
"owned kernel. Unintegrated backends are not advertised as supported "
"placeholders."

#: ../../../../../../nexus/docs/explanation/motor-control.md:102
msgid ""
"操作入口见[控制与智能器件](../guides/control-and-smart-devices.md)，权威公共声明见 [电机与轴 "
"API](../reference/api/components/control.md)及 [耦合采样 "
"API](../reference/api/io/analog.md)。"
msgstr ""
"For operation, see [control and smart devices](../guides/control-and-smart-"
"devices.md). Authoritative public declarations are in the [motor and axis "
"API](../reference/api/components/control.md) and [coupled sampling "
"API](../reference/api/io/analog.md)."
